<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan court sentences two bombers to death.</title>
<headline>Pakistan court sentences two bombers to death.</headline>
<dateline>LAHORE, Pakistan 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>A Pakistani anti-terrorist court sentenced two men to death on Thursday for a bomb blast at Lahore airport in July that killed four people and wounded nearly 70, court officials said.</p>
<p>The court found Ishaq Mirasi and Shamsher Shah, both Pakistanis, guilty of the bombing, which police said was sabotage sponsored by intelligence agents of neighbouring India.</p>
